---
description: Git commits and PR text must be in English
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git messages in English

- **All `git commit` messages** (subject and body) must be written in **English**, not Spanish or other languages, unless the user explicitly asks for a different language in that session.
- The same applies to **pull request titles and descriptions** in this project.

Use Conventional Commits style when it fits the repo (e.g. `fix:`, `feat:`), and keep the subject line clear and imperative.
